1857966401352", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12533755_174965649666375_263137098444308480_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YDtkSAVvP1cQ7kNvwGdeV4i&_nc_oc=AdohKAscG_4exNwDcts_jNVb1-P_cdLzBF0hHTyPJoQXhtdOTUIhKdkzICaFM3Hbihw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfxVMPe4ketU5oSaehWZnf2CsMghwJ5wWHi8f4y6IdEPAw&oe=69C51229"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "200904117837737", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12331199_403996186617400_1247254869216067584_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TVGtFetvylMQ7kNvwFOlU_U&_nc_oc=AdpL_NOyY7sl6FMntkVTdQWPEX_108fuD-l_VD0ViAXC5vZUhjtcEjV0MLLrccH5jA0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfzqLmcUyCnqTUpLqum558U97MHfRQnTMwV53j9g6XiJZg&oe=69C53F21"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2645245402426315", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12602136_1306802762745008_16700533653897216_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WkpStie3oYsQ7kNvwExEPNH&_nc_oc=AdqC7G-1JyGvtphwlQWkeMeDdt6HgppJkQClgBwI86MY7QfOM46tZ7D5iND2aYEZ6RI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfwzU03UP8ugcdU2eYvoKCYKTaEC6HG8p6hjS8Hy-Rgydw&oe=69C534E9"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MYTF1 VR : R\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle et vid\u00e9os 360", "keywords": ["tf1", "video", "voice", "s\u00e9rie", "replay"], "long_description": "C\u2019est le moment de vous pr\u00e9parer \u00e0 une immersion totale au c\u0153ur de contenus exclusifs s\u00e9lectionn\u00e9s par TF1, LCI, MYTF1 et MYTF1XTRA sur MYTF1 VR ! The Voice VR : prenez la place des coachs et buzzez quand vous le souhaitez\u2026 Fan de The Voice ? A l\u2019occasion de la nouvelle saison du plus c\u00e9l\u00e8bre concours TV de chant, vous pourrez acc\u00e9der \u00e0 toutes les auditions \u00e0 l\u2019aveugle en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle ! Vivez des sensations fortes en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle \u00e0 travers des exp\u00e9riences in\u00e9dites sur mytf1vr. Retrouvez un catalogue r\u00e9guli\u00e8rement enrichi de vid\u00e9os en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle sur MYTF1 VR : sport, info, documentaires, divertissements, reportages et contenus in\u00e9dits ! Explorez des lieux interdits et vivez des experiences incroyables : visitez les pyramides de Kh\u00e9ops, montez \u00e0 bord d\u2019une Formule 1, d\u00e9couvrez l\u2019int\u00e9rieur de la grotte de Lascaux\u2026 Et t\u00e9l\u00e9chargez les vid\u00e9os 360 pour une meilleure qualit\u00e9 de visionnage.", "short_description": "C\u2019est le moment de vous pr\u00e9parer \u00e0 une immersion totale au c\u0153ur de contenus exclusifs s\u00e9lectionn\u00e9s par TF1, LCI, MYTF1 et MYTF1XTRA sur MYTF1 VR ! Fan de The Voice ? Avec l'exp\u00e9rience The Voice VR disponible dans l'application MYTF1VR : prenez la place des coachs et buzzez quand vous le souhaitez !"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.tf1.fr/politique-de-confidentialite/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://s.tf1.fr/mmdia/a/59/1/11593591hnlxj.pdf", "publisher_name": "TF1", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.tf1.fr/", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["CASUAL", "MUSIC_VIDEO", "SPORTS"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["fr"], "supported_input_devices": ["TOUCHPAD"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "481649109979279"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162814_102585153625543_6861941589